{
  "_about": "The order in which walkthrough videos go out on YouTube (scripts/tutorials/youtube-schedule.ts). Each track is one area of the product, in the order a new user should meet its videos. The scheduler takes one video from each track in turn (top to bottom, then round again), so the three videos of a day come from three different areas and each area still plays in its learning order. A key that is not produced yet keeps its place in its track; a produced key that is in no track goes in a last track, 'other', alphabetically. Slots already scheduled are never reshuffled. Keys are the rows of CRM-VIDEO-PLAN.md.",
